          "snippet": {
            "line": 368,
            "text": "noncomputable def radialRemainder (o : Operators D) (b m h : Triple D) : Field D :=\n  -o.time h.radial - o.radialDiv 1 (deltaRadialRadial b m h) -\n    o.dz (deltaAxialRadial b m h) + o.invRadius * radialAngularRemainder m h +\n    o.viscosity 1 h.radial"
